SIMPLE  =                    T / Fits standard                                  BITPIX  =                   16 / Bits per pixel                                 NAXIS   =                    0 / Number of axes                                 EXTEND  =                    T / File may contain extensions                    DATE    = '2020-04-30'         / Date FITS file was generated                   NEXTEND =                    1 / number of extensions in file                   DETECTOR= 'WFC     '                                                            INSTRUME= 'ACS     '                                                            NORDER  =                    5                                                  PARITY  =                   -1                                                  FILETYPE= 'DISTORTION COEFFICIENTS'                                             DESCRIP = 'IDCTAB based on absolute Gaia DR2 and Sahlmann V2V3 SIAF values.'    USEAFTER= 'Jan 01 2009 00:00:00' / From SM04 to FSW update                      PEDIGREE= 'INFLIGHT 01/06/2002 01/06/2002'                                      TDD_DATE=              2011.25                                                  TDD_CTB1=     1.3811931398E-06 / Yrotation cy_11                                TDD_CTB2=     1.2821616374E-06 / Yrotation cy_11                                TDD_CXB1=    -8.3495902109E-07 / Xscale cx_11                                   TDD_CXB2=    -9.0660654172E-07 / Xscale cx_11                                   FILENAME= '4bb1536cj_idc.fits'                                                  ROOTNAME= '4BB1536CJ_IDC'                                                       COMMENT Created by S.L. Hoffmann on 2020-04-30 as described in ACS-ISR-2020-09. COMMENT Coefficients scaled by VAFACTOR for velocity aberration effect.         COMMENT Linear time-dependency distortion parameters are included in the header.HISTORY This file contains 5th order polynomial coefficients of the geometric   HISTORY distortion for 10 ACS/WFC filters and their clear counterparts:         HISTORY F606W F775W F475W F502N F625W F658N F555W F435W F814W F850LP.           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The coefficients for F550M and F660N duplicate the coefficients of      HISTORY F555W and F658N respectively due to lack of observations.               HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The calibration of the ACS/WFC geometric distortion is fully discribed  HISTORY by Kozhurina-Platias, et. al, ACS-ISR-2015-06, and improved by          HISTORY calibration w.r.t Gaia DR2 Kozhurina-Platais, et. al, ACS-ISR-2018-01.  HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The reference points for the HST V2V3 coordinates system                HISTORY were updated with newly derived SIAF values w.r.t Gaia DR2              HISTORY by S. Sahlmann, et.al, TEL-ISR-2019.                                    HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The values of polarizer subarrays are XSIZE = 2048 and YSIZE = 2046,    HISTORY which are the values from before the flight software change in 2016.    HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY Ramp filter coefficients contain the old, 4th order, coefficients       HISTORY with the 5th order coefficients set to zero. Due to lack of data        HISTORY we are unable to fully calibrate these filters to the same precision    HISTORY as other filters.                                                       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY Polarizer coefficients use the full frame coefficients from the         HISTORY accompanying color filter crossed with CLEAR as that gives the closest  HISTORY results to the actual distortion.                                       HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY This file contains an entry for every possible combination of filters   HISTORY in the filter wheel even if they are not a valid combination for WFC.   HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY GAIA_POST_USEAFTER2009_idc.fits renamed to 4bb1536cj_idc.fits on Nov 11 HISTORY 2020                                                                    END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             XTENSION= 'BINTABLE'           / binary table extension                         BITPIX  =                    8 / 8-bit bytes                                    NAXIS   =                    2 / 2-dimensional binary table                     